","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910521005:1":{"text":"我也不知道，流光海的深处，竟然还有如此美丽而致命的存在……","source_cn":"我也不知道，流光海的深处，竟然还有如此美丽而致命的存在……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x4562F4E841C03B2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"那种潮光会溶解生物？！","source_cn":"那种潮光会溶解生物？！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x1228FB5E835E46F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910521006:1":{"text":"因为……打不过咱？","source_cn":"因为……打不过咱？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x3150C87BABC788CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910521007:1":{"text":"不对……就算打不过，他们为什么又要主动走到潮光里？那个...","source_cn":"不对……就算打不过，他们为什么又要主动走到潮光里？那个...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910521008:1":{"text":"突然停下所有动作，看向同一个方向，默默地走进潮光中……","source_cn":"突然停下所有动作，看向同一个方向，默默地走进潮光中……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x5CDC9ABE79108EBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910521009:1":{"text":"可能……他们，想回家了。\\n我也……想回家，好可怕……","source_cn":"可能